# LEARNING OUTCOME 1: APPLY PROMPT STRUCTURE & ROLE-BASED PROMPTING

### Information Sheet 1.1

**The anatomy of a strong prompt:**

| Element | Purpose | Example |
|---------|---------|---------|
| **Role** | Tells AI who to act as | "Act as a career coach…" |
| **Instruction** | The task | "…review this resume…" |
| **Context** | Background details | "…for an entry-level IT job…" |
| **Format** | How to answer | "…list 5 bullet improvements." |

**Role / Persona prompting** sets the tone, expertise, and style of the answer.
Compare:
> ❌ "Explain databases."
> ✅ "Act as a patient teacher explaining databases to a 12-year-old using a
> library analogy."

